 ('ENT_PGM_AKEPHALOS','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The Headless One is a major PGM invoked god.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_AKEPHALOS','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','high','The Stele of Jeu invokes Akephalos for exorcism and protective authority over spirits.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_AKEPHALOS','mediated_by','ENT_THEURGY','medium','The Akephalos creator-god is addressed as the source of cosmic order in ritual command.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_KOSMOKRATOR','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Kosmokrator is a title of the supreme invoked god in the PGM.',''),
