 ('ENT_PGM_KOSMOKRATOR','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','low','As ruler of the cosmos he is invoked for command and protective authority over powers.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_AERIAL_DAIMONES','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The aerial and chthonic daimones are a standing class of PGM-invoked spirits.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_AERIAL_DAIMONES','mediated_by','ENT_THEURGY','medium','The intermediary daimones are the operative spirits of PGM ritual practice.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_AERIAL_DAIMONES','presides_over','ENT_POSSESSION','medium','These daimones are summoned as assistant-spirits and into mediums in the PGM.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_ABLANATHANALBA','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The palindrome is a recurrent named power across the PGM and amulets.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_ABLANATHANALBA','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','high','Ablanathanalba is invoked as a protective apotropaic power.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_SESENGENBARPHARANGES','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Sesengenbarpharanges is a recurrent named power in PGM protective and binding spells.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_SESENGENBARPHARANGES','paired_with','ENT_PGM_ABLANATHANALBA','high','The two names co-occur on PGM amulets as a protective pair.',''),
 ('ENT_PGM_SESENGENBARPHARANGES','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','medium','It is invoked for protective and binding effect in PGM formulae.',''),
 ('ENT_BAS_ABRASAX','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The Basilidean 365-power Abrasax is among the supreme names invoked across the PGM and on magical gems.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_OPH_IAO','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Iao, the vocalized tetragrammaton, is the great magical name recurring throughout the PGM.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_OPH_SABAOTH','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Sabaoth (''Lord of Hosts'') is a standard PGM name of power, chained with Iao and Adonai.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_OPH_ADONAIOS','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Adonai occurs in the Iao-Sabaoth-Adonai sequence of PGM invocations.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_SYN_AION','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Aion is invoked as a supreme cosmic power in PGM IV and XIII.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_EGY_SETH','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Seth, equated with Typhon, is the principal coercive power of PGM aggressive and curse magic.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_HELIOS','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Helios is invoked as the all-seeing solar lord and revealer in PGM solar spells.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_EGY_RA','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Ra (as Phre, pa-Ra) is invoked as the sun-god in transliterated solar formulae of the PGM.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_SELENE','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Selene heads the composite lunar goddess of the great PGM IV love-and-curse spells.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_HECATE','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Hekate is fused into the triple lunar goddess invoked in PGM IV.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_MES_ERESHKIGAL','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The Mesopotamian queen of the dead is invoked as a chthonic lunar name fused with Hekate in PGM lunar spells.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_EGY_BES','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Oracular Bes is invoked to send dream-oracles in the PGM Bes divination spells.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_SYN_HARPOCRATES','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Harpocrates on the lotus is invoked as the newborn sun and protective power in PGM and amuletic magic.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_AGATHOS_DAIMON','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The benevolent serpent-spirit Agathodaimon is invoked as a protective and revealing power in the PGM.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_ANANKE','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','Necessity/Ananke is personified and invoked in the PGM compulsion formulae that force gods to obey.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_PAN','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','medium','Pan-the-All is invoked in PGM cosmic hymns through the wordplay Pan = ''the All''.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_SYN_MITHRAS','member_of','ENT_PGM_INVOKED_POWERS','high','The Mithras of PGM IV''s ''Mithras Liturgy'' is invoked as the solar god of a ritual ascent and immortalization rite.','SRC_GREEK_MAGICAL_PAPYRI'),
 ('ENT_JM_SEFER_HARAZIM_ANGELS','member_of','ENT_JM_SEVEN_FIRMAMENTS','high','The angelic host is organized by and inhabits the seven-firmament structure of Sefer ha-Razim.',''),
